  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen EIFORCES&#x2019; Training Capacity for Peace Support Operations in the Sub Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project main goals are :- Reinforce EIFORCES capabilities to bolster Cameroon and the subregion&#x2019;s Security Forces preparedness and readiness in building sustainable peace and security in the subregion;- Consolidate research capabilities for adequate situation analysis for the benefit of national and sub-regional decision makers;- Provide specific equipment to support training and improvement of working conditions for EIFORCES staff.</narrative>
  </description>
